// Request-body assembly from flattened inputs.
//
// A body-taking command layers three input sources, deepest wins:
//
//	-f/--file <doc>          the whole body (YAML or JSON)
//	--<node> <doc>           a document for one subtree
//	--<leaf> <value>         one typed value
//
// Discriminated unions are stamped from the arm whose inputs were used (or
// an explicit tag), documents are checked against the request schema
// (unknown fields dropped with a warning, enum short forms expanded,
// required paths reported by flag name), and partial updates derive their
// field mask from the paths that were set.

